  "query_preview": "..\n(Sunday Night through Saturday)\nIssued at 1118 PM CDT Sat Sep 12 2026\n\nAdditional heat headlines are likely in the coming days as summer\nrages on. Strengthening low level flow early next week will also\nraise fire weather concerns to some degree in areas that miss out\non the current rainfall. Configuration of headlines may vary some,\nbut bottom line is another multiple day stretch of heat is coming.\nThunderstorm chances may flirt with northern areas during the \nweek but most areas remain dry.\n\nMedium range models continue to show an eventual breakdown of the\nupper ridge and the passage of a cold front by about next \nweekend, though exactly when this happens remains in question.",
